  "provenance": "SYNTHETIC, as session-queued-turn.synthetic.json but with the opposite ordering: turn 2's own init arrives first and the queued turn's init/result pair follows, so two system/init records are open at once. Both orderings must end turn 2 on turn 2's own result.",
